By adding the topology to a kafka streams app:

```java  
    @Inject
    private TopologyProducer topologyProducer;
    @Inject
    private KafkaStreams kafkaStreams;

    @BeforeAll
    public void init() throws InterruptedException {
        Properties configMap = EmbeddedKafkaBrokerTestResource.getConfigMap();
        configMap.put("quarkus.kafka-streams.application-id", "embedded-kafka-streams-test");
        configMap.put("application.id", "embedded-kafka-streams-test");
        kafkaStreams = new KafkaStreams(topologyProducer.buildTopology(), configMap);
        kafkaStreams.cleanUp();
        kafkaStreams.start();
    }
```
